      "key": "lesson",
      "name": "上課用語",
      "intro": "今天是開學第一天！主角在校門口遇到同學，他們在說什麼呢？",
      "characters": [
        {
          "id": "classmate",
          "name": "同學",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/girl.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "protagonist",
          "name": "主角",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/boy.png"
        }
      ],
      "turns": [
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-lesson-1",
          "order": 1,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "Ima hangan su",
          "chineseText": "你叫甚麼名字？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62840/875393.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-lesson-2",
          "order": 2,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "Hangan mu o Tadaw",
          "chineseText": "我叫Kacaw。",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62840/875394.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/boy.png",
          "background": "1-2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-lesson-3",
          "order": 3,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "Gaga inu ka sapah su",
          "chineseText": "你的家在哪裡？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62840/875395.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-lesson-4",
          "order": 4,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "Pnaah ku alang Ihunang.",
          "chineseText": "我從紅葉部落來。",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62840/875396.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/boy.png",
          "background": "1-2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-lesson-5",
          "order": 5,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "Mnkan su uqan mgrbu dhug?",
          "chineseText": "你吃早餐了嗎？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62840/875397.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-lesson-6",
          "order": 6,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "Ini na",
          "chineseText": "還沒耶！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62840/875398.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/boy.png",
          "background": "1-2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-lesson-7",
          "order": 7,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "Mowsa ku marig uqan mgrbu,tqnay su mowsa hug?",
          "chineseText": "我要去買早餐，要一起去嗎？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62840/875399.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-lesson-8",
          "order": 8,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "Ini ku adas pila,tduwa su psiyuk pila knan hug?",
          "chineseText": "我沒有帶錢。你可以借我錢嗎？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62840/875400.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/boy.png",
          "background": "1-2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-lesson-9",
          "order": 9,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "Aq, Ksukay misu",
          "chineseText": "好，我借你。",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62840/875401.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/lesson/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.jpg"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "find",
      "name": "尋找物品",
      "intro": "今天家裡要辦婚禮，很多親戚都來了。看到大家忙得不可開交，主角決定要幫大家一起準備。",
      "characters": [
        {
          "id": "classmate",
          "name": "同學",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/girl.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "mother",
          "name": "媽媽",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/mom.png"
        }
      ],
      "turns": [
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-find-1",
          "order": 1,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "Bubu,jiyax sayang bharaw bi lutut miyah sapah ta .",
          "chineseText": "媽媽今天家裡來了好多親戚哦！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66275/924655.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-find-2",
          "order": 2,
          "speaker": "mother",
          "speakerName": "媽媽",
          "indigenousText": "Jiyax pntrian qbsuran snaw ka sayang,kika bharaw bi seejiq miyah.",
          "chineseText": "今天是哥哥的婚禮，所以有很多人來。",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66275/924656.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/mom.png",
          "background": "1-2.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-find-3",
          "order": 3,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "Paru bi qrasun! Bsiyaq bi ini qtai ka dhiya da!",
          "chineseText": "好開心喔！很久沒有看到他們了！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66275/924657.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-find-4",
          "order": 4,
          "speaker": "mother",
          "speakerName": "媽媽",
          "indigenousText": "Kiya wah!Tbbiyax ta bi ka jiyax sayang,iyah dmayaw kana ka isu.",
          "chineseText": "對啊！今天大家都會很忙，你要幫忙大家。",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66275/924658.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/mom.png",
          "background": "1-2.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-find-5",
          "order": 5,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "Aq,ida ku meyah",
          "chineseText": "好的，我一定會！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66275/924659.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-find-6",
          "order": 6,
          "speaker": "mother",
          "speakerName": "媽媽",
          "indigenousText": "Musa ku psramal qnqaya djiyun kiya han.",
          "chineseText": "我要去準備等一下要用的東西了。",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66275/924660.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/mom.png",
          "background": "1-2.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-find-7",
          "order": 7,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "Miyax ku dmayaw do.",
          "chineseText": "我來幫忙！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66275/924661.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-find-8",
          "order": 8,
          "speaker": "mother",
          "speakerName": "媽媽",
          "indigenousText": "Aq,iyah sengul knan.",
          "chineseText": "好，你跟我來！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66275/924662.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/mom.png",
          "background": "1-2.png"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "outside",
      "name": "戶外活動",
      "intro": "今天是星期六。主角正在和哥哥聊天，討論明天的行程。來看看他們要去哪裡玩吧！",
      "characters": [
        {
          "id": "protagonist",
          "name": "主角",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "sibling",
          "name": "哥哥",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-2.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "mother",
          "name": "媽媽",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/mom.png"
        }
      ],
      "turns": [
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-outside-1",
          "order": 1,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "Lowking,jiyax sngayang ka saman,mmowsa su inu hug King?",
          "chineseText": "Lowking，明天是星期天，你打算去哪裡？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65802/919546.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-1.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-outside-2",
          "order": 2,
          "speaker": "sibling",
          "speakerName": "哥哥",
          "indigenousText": "Mmowsa nami muduh siyang ayu hiya ka yaku ni Rabay, isu ga?",
          "chineseText": "我明天要和Rabay去溪邊烤肉，你呢？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65802/919547.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-2.png",
          "background": "1-2.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-outside-3",
          "order": 3,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "Qbhangan,saw bi malu bi rwauun!Tduwa ku tqnay mowsa hug?",
          "chineseText": "聽起來很好玩！我也可以一起去嗎？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65802/919548.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-1.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-outside-4",
          "order": 4,
          "speaker": "sibling",
          "speakerName": "哥哥",
          "indigenousText": "Sliging ka bubu su han",
          "chineseText": "你先問媽媽！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65802/919549.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-2.png",
          "background": "1-2.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-outside-5",
          "order": 5,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "Bubu,tduwa ku tqnay qbsuran mu snaw musa ayung hug",
          "chineseText": "媽媽，我可以跟哥哥一起去溪邊嗎？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65802/919550.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-1.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-outside-6",
          "order": 6,
          "speaker": "mother",
          "speakerName": "媽媽",
          "indigenousText": "Tduwa,kiya ni asi namu ka qmlahang!",
          "chineseText": "可以，但你們要小心喔！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65802/919551.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/mom.png",
          "background": "1-3.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "33-hordequest-outside-7",
          "order": 7,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "Ini huya,ida nami musa qmlahang baly.",
          "chineseText": "沒問題，我們一定會的！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65802/919552.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-1.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        }
      ]
    }
